// La fanciulla del West, complete Act 2; source: user-supplied 1910 Italian libretto PDF.
// All directions and spoken/sung text retained in source order. English: unreviewed assistant draft.
export const fanciullaActTwoScenes = [{"number":1,"originalHeading":"Atto secondo","translatedHeading":"Act II","summary":"Minnie and Johnson meet at her mountain cabin. Rance discovers them, and a poker game determines Johnson’s fate.","sections":[{"type":"Passage","listeningLandmark":true,"routeItem":0,"originalTitle":"Il mio bimbo è grande e piccino","translatedTitle":"My baby is big and little","threeLineOutline":true,"sourceTitlesOnly":true,"participants":["Wowkle","Billy"],"turns":[{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":0,"sourcePage":24,"original":"L’abitazione di Minnie. È composta di una sola stanza, alla quale sovrasta un solaio, ove sono accatastati, con un certo ordine, bauli, casse vuote ed altri oggetti. La stanza è tappezzata nel gusto dell’epoca. Nel centro, in fondo, una porta che si apre sopra un breve vestibolo. A destra e a sinistra della porta, due finestre con tendine. Al solaio si sale per una scala a piuoli agganciata ad un trave. Appoggiato sulla parete di sinistra il letto, con la testa spinta sotto la tettoia formata dal solaio, coperto da un baldacchino di cretonne a fiorellini. Ai piedi del letto, un piccolo tavolo, con sopra una catinella e la brocca dell’acqua, ed un canterano sul quale stanno diversi oggetti di toilette femminile. Su una corda stanno stese calze bianche. Da un lato, in fondo, un armadio di legno di pino, sullo sportello del quale è appeso un attaccapanni con una vestaglia ed uno scialletto. Accanto all’armadio un focolare basso, sulla cui cappa stanno una vecchia pendola, un lume a petrolio senza campana, una bottiglia di whisky ed un bicchiere. Un’altra mensola a tre ripiani, accanto al focolare, con piatti, vasetti, oggetti di cucina, della crema, dei biscotti, una zuccheriera. Dinanzi al focolare una pelle d’orso. Quasi dinanzi alla porta, un poco più verso il focolare, una tavola con tre sedie. Un lume pende dal soffitto sopra la tavola. Fra la tavola e il focolare, una sedia a dondolo, fatta con un vecchio barile tagliato a metà e posto sopra due mezze lune di legno. Altre sedie di cuoio, disposte qua e là. Alle pareti sono appese vecchie oleografie e molti altri bizzarri oggetti. Non è passato un’ora dal primo atto.\nQuando si alza la tela Wowkle è accoccolata per terra, presso al fuoco, col bambino nella cuna portatile che ha appesa sul dorso. Indossa una cappa di panno, e sotto a questa una sottana rossa di cotone. La cappa è aperta sul collo e rovesciata; alla vita è legata da una sciarpa rossa a frange. Piannelle di pelle di cervo; capelli spartiti nel mezzo, cadenti in due treccie, legati da un nastro che le fascia la fronte. Al collo molte collane di vetro di vari colori e a file rosse e bianche. Orecchini e braccialetti d’argento. È giovane, è dolce, piena, floscia, sensuale: il tipo della donna indiana. Occhi piccoli e tondi. Con voce molle e monotona canta al bimbo una ninna nanna, cullandoselo sul dorso. Il lume sopra la tavola è mezzo abbassato.)\n(cullando il bambino con voce piana e dolce)","translation":"Minnie's home. It consists of one room beneath a loft, where trunks, empty boxes and other objects are stacked in fairly good order. The room is decorated in the fashion of the time. A door at the rear opens onto a small vestibule, with curtained windows on either side; a ladder hanging from a beam gives access to the loft. Against the left wall stands the bed, partly beneath the loft and covered by a floral canopy. At its foot are a small table, a basin, a water jug and a chest with women's toilet articles. White stockings hang on a line. At the back stands a pine wardrobe with a dressing gown and shawl hanging from its door. Beside it is a low hearth; on its mantel are an old clock, an oil lamp, a whisky bottle and a glass. A three-tier shelf holds plates, dishes, cream, biscuits and a sugar bowl. There is a bearskin before the hearth, a table with three chairs, and a hanging lamp. Between table and hearth is a rocking chair made from a barrel, and other leather chairs stand about. Old prints and curious objects\nhang on the walls. Less than an hour has passed since Act I. As the curtain rises, Wowkle sits crouched by the fire with her child in a cradle strapped to her back. She wears a cloth cape, a red cotton skirt, a fringed red sash, deerskin shoes, two braids bound with a ribbon around her forehead, colored bead necklaces, and silver earrings and bracelets. Young and soft-featured, she sings a lullaby in a gentle monotonous voice while rocking the child. The lamp over the table is turned low.\n(Rocking the baby softly.)"},{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":1,"sourcePage":24,"original":"«Il mio bimbo è grande e piccino,\nè piccino, sta dentro la cuna,\nè grande e tocca la luna,\ntocca la luna col suo ditino.\nHao, wari! Hao, wari!…”","translation":"My baby is big and little;\nhe is little, inside the cradle,\nyet big enough to touch the moon,\nto touch the moon with his little finger.\nHao, wari! Hao, wari!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":2,"sourcePage":24,"original":"(Billy batte all’uscio ed entra. Spesso, durante la scena, i due indiani emettono un mugolio sordo, fra nasale e gutturale, molte simile ad un grugnito)\n(entrando, come un saluto)","translation":"(Billy knocks and enters. During the scene, both utter low nasal and guttural murmurs, almost like grunts.\nEntering by way of greeting.)"},{"speaker":"BILLY","speakerTranslation":"Billy","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":3,"sourcePage":24,"original":"Ugh…","translation":"Ugh..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":4,"sourcePage":24,"original":"(rispondendo)","translation":"(Replying.)"},{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":5,"sourcePage":24,"original":"Ugh…","translation":"Ugh..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":6,"sourcePage":24,"original":"(Billy vede sulla tavola i biscotti e la crema. Ha uno sguardo cupido, fa per assaggiare)\n(indicando la tavola)","translation":"(Billy sees the biscuits and cream on the table, looks greedily at them and reaches to taste some.\nWowkle points to the table.)"},{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":7,"sourcePage":24,"original":"Crema… Biscotti…\nPadrona… Non toccare…","translation":"Cream... Biscuits...\nMistress... Don't touch!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":8,"sourcePage":24,"original":"(Vede in terra la carta della crema. La raccoglie. Si siede accanto a Wowkle con indifferenza)","translation":"(Billy notices the paper containing the cream on the floor, picks it up and sits beside Wowkle, indifferent.)"},{"speaker":"BILLY","speakerTranslation":"Billy","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":9,"sourcePage":24,"original":"Tua padrona mandare.\nDice: Billy sposare…","translation":"Your mistress sent me.\nShe says Billy must marry..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":10,"sourcePage":24,"original":"(noncurante)","translation":"(Indifferently.)"},{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":11,"sourcePage":24,"original":"Wowkle non sapere…","translation":"Wowkle not know..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":12,"sourcePage":24,"original":"(Silenzio dei due indiani)","translation":"(Silence between the two.)"},{"speaker":"BILLY","speakerTranslation":"Billy","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":13,"sourcePage":24,"original":"Che cosa dare tuo padre \nper nozze?","translation":"What will you give your father\nfor the wedding?"},{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":14,"sourcePage":24,"original":"Non sapere.","translation":"Not know."},{"speaker":"BILLY","speakerTranslation":"Billy","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":15,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Billy dar quattro dollari\ntuo padre: e una coperta…","translation":"Billy give your father\nfour dollars and a blanket..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":16,"sourcePage":25,"original":"(si lecca le dita)","translation":"(Licking his fingers.)"},{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":17,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Wowkle dire: tenere\ncoperta noi per bimbo…","translation":"Wowkle say: keep the blanket\nfor us and the baby..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":18,"sourcePage":25,"original":"(pavoneggiandosi)","translation":"(Strutting proudly.)"},{"speaker":"BILLY","speakerTranslation":"Billy","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":19,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Nostro bimbo!","translation":"Our baby!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":20,"sourcePage":25,"original":"(Dà a Wowkle un pezzetto di carta con la crema, che lecca avidamente; accende la pipa, poi la passa a Wowkle che tira una boccata e gliela rende)","translation":"(He gives Wowkle a bit of paper with cream, which she eagerly licks. He lights his pipe, passes it to her; she takes a puff and hands it back.)"},{"speaker":"BILLY","speakerTranslation":"Billy","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":21,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Domani chiesa cantare…\n“Come fil d’erba è il giorno…»","translation":"Tomorrow at church sing...\n“Like a blade of grass is the day...”"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":22,"sourcePage":25,"original":"(Wowkle riconosce l’aria, con un grugnito di soddisfazione si stringe a Billy, spalla a spalla, e canta con lui con voce un po’ nasale, dondolandosi)","translation":"(Recognizing the tune, Wowkle gives a satisfied grunt, nestles shoulder to shoulder with Billy, and sings with him in a slightly nasal voice while rocking.)"},{"speaker":"WOWKLE, BILLY","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle, Billy","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":23,"sourcePage":25,"original":"«…che all’uomo die’ il Signor…»","translation":"“...that the Lord gave to man...”"},{"speaker":"BILLY","speakerTranslation":"Billy","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":24,"sourcePage":25,"original":"«…scende l’inverno al piano…»","translation":"“...winter descends upon the plain...”"},{"speaker":"WOWKLE, BILLY","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle, Billy","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":25,"sourcePage":25,"original":"«…l’uomo intristisce e muor!»","translation":"“...man grows weak and dies!”"},{"speaker":"BILLY","speakerTranslation":"Billy","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":26,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Dopo sposare: avere perle e whisky!","translation":"After marriage, have beads and whisky!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":27,"sourcePage":25,"original":"(Si leva di tasca un fazzoletto, lo piega, lo mostra a Wowkle e lo mette nella culla del bambino.)","translation":"(He takes a handkerchief from his pocket, folds it, shows it to Wowkle and puts it in the child's cradle.)"},{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":28,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Ugh…","translation":"Ugh..."},{"speaker":"BILLY","speakerTranslation":"Billy","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":29,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Ugh…","translation":"Ugh..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":30,"sourcePage":25,"original":"(si alza)","translation":"(Rising.)"},{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":31,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Ecco padrona!","translation":"Here comes mistress!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":32,"sourcePage":25,"original":"(Minnie appare sulla porta. Entra tenendo in alto la \nlanterna; la sua luce colpisce tu viso i due indiani, che si scostano e si ritraggono confusi. Minnie mal reprime una interna commozione: guarda intorno per la stanza, come a spiare che effetto farà la sua casa su Johnson. Ha un mantello rosso sopra il suo abito del primo atto. Depone la lanterna sulla tavola. Wowkle alza la fiamma al lume della tavola)\n(rapidamente)","translation":"(Minnie appears in the doorway, holding up a lantern.\nIts light falls on Billy and Wowkle, who move aside in confusion. Minnie can scarcely contain her emotion, looking around as though imagining what Johnson will think of her home. She wears a red cloak over her Act I dress, sets down the lantern, and Wowkle turns up the table lamp.\nMinnie speaks quickly.)"}]},{"type":"Passage","listeningLandmark":true,"routeItem":1,"originalTitle":"Billy, è fissato?","translatedTitle":"Billy, is it arranged?","threeLineOutline":true,"sourceTitlesOnly":true,"participants":["Minnie","Billy","Wowkle"],"turns":[{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":33,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Billy, è fissato?","translation":"Billy, is it arranged?"},{"speaker":"BILLY","speakerTranslation":"Billy","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":34,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Domani…","translation":"Tomorrow..."},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":35,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Sta bene. \nVa’ via.","translation":"Very well.\nGo away."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":36,"sourcePage":25,"original":"(Billy esce.)\n(A Wowkle)","translation":"(Billy exits.)\n(To Wowkle.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":37,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Stanotte, Wowkle, cena per due.","translation":"Wowkle, tonight there will be supper for two."},{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":38,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Altro venire?  Ugh!… Mai prima d’ora.","translation":"Someone else coming? Ugh! Never before."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":39,"sourcePage":25,"original":"(appende il mantello all’attaccapanni)","translation":"(Minnie hangs her cloak on the stand.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":40,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Zitta, e pulisci!\nChe ora è?","translation":"Quiet, and clean up!\nWhat time is it?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":41,"sourcePage":25,"original":"(Wowkle piglia la lanterna sulla tavola e l’appende nel vestibolo fra le due porte di fondo)","translation":"(Wowkle takes the lantern from the table and hangs it in the vestibule between the rear doors.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":42,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Sarà qui fra poco…","translation":"He'll be here shortly..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":43,"sourcePage":25,"original":"(Si leva gli stivaletti e li getta a Wowkle; questa li raccatta e va a riporli nell’armadio a destra))","translation":"(Minnie takes off her boots and tosses them to Wowkle, who picks them up and puts them in the wardrobe on the right.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":44,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Piglia!","translation":"Here, take them!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":45,"sourcePage":25,"original":"(graziosa)","translation":"(Prettily.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":46,"sourcePage":25,"original":"Dove hai messo le mie rose rosse?","translation":"Where have you put my red roses?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":47,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(indican il canterano, col solito grugnito, poi si leva la cuna portatile col bimbo e va a posarla accanto al fuoco e comincia ad apparecchiare la tavola)","translation":"(Wowkle points to the chest of drawers with her usual grunt, then takes off the portable cradle, places it by the fire, and begins setting the table.)"},{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":48,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Ugh…","translation":"Ugh..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":49,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(si trae dal petto la pistola e la ripone nel cassetto. Prende le rose e se le appunta fra i capelli guardandosi allo specchio)","translation":"(Minnie takes the pistol from her breast and puts it in a drawer. She pins roses in her hair while looking in the mirror.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":50,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Il bimbo come sta?\nBilly davvero \nt’ha detto…?","translation":"How is the baby?\nDid Billy\nreally tell you...?"},{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":51,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Noi sposare.","translation":"We marry."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":52,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(gettandole un nastro)","translation":"(Throwing her a ribbon.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":53,"sourcePage":26,"original":"To’, pel bimbo!","translation":"There, for the baby!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":54,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(Wowkle ripone il nastro, continua ad apparecchiare.) ","translation":"(Wowkle puts away the ribbon and continues setting the table.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":55,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Vorrei mettermi queste. Le scarpette \ndi Monterey…","translation":"I would like to wear these—my shoes\nfrom Monterey..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":56,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(si siede in terra, e incomincia a infilarsene una)","translation":"(Sitting on the floor, she begins putting one on.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":57,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Purché mi riesca\nd’infilarle…","translation":"If only I can manage\nto get them on..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":58,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(La scarpetta, con grande sforzo è infilata.)","translation":"(With great effort the shoe goes on.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":59,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Ahi! Son strette!…","translation":"Ouch! They are tight!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":60,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(Poi anche l’altra scarpetta è calzata. Si alza, cammina un po’ zoppicando)","translation":"(She manages the second shoe, rises and walks with a slight limp.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":61,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Guardami… credi che gli piaceranno?","translation":"Look at me... do you think he'll like them?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":62,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(Va al canterano con aria contenta)","translation":"(She goes happily to the chest of drawers.)"}]},{"type":"Passage","listeningLandmark":true,"routeItem":2,"originalTitle":"Voglio vestirmi tutta","translatedTitle":"I want to dress up completely","threeLineOutline":true,"sourceTitlesOnly":true,"participants":["Minnie","Johnson","Wowkle"],"turns":[{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":63,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Voglio vestirmi tutta come in giorno di festa,\ntutta, da capo a piedi.","translation":"I want to dress as though for a holiday,\ncompletely, from head to toe."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":64,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(Si butta sulle spalle lo scialle e si guarda nello specchio)","translation":"(She throws the shawl over her shoulders and looks in the mirror.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":65,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Non son poi tanto brutta…","translation":"I'm not so ugly after all..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":66,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(si versa dell’acqua di Colonia nel fazzoletto)","translation":"(She pours cologne onto her handkerchief.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":67,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Anche il profumo… Vedi?","translation":"And perfume too... See?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":68,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(S’infila i guanti)","translation":"(She puts on her gloves.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":69,"sourcePage":26,"original":"E i guanti… È più d’un anno \nche non li metto!…","translation":"And the gloves... It's been over a\nyear since I wore them!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":70,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(guardandosi ancora, impacciata e contenta, e volgendosi a Wowkle)","translation":"(Looking at herself, awkward but pleased, and turning toward Wowkle.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":71,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Non sarò poi troppo elegante?","translation":"Won't I look too dressed up?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":72,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(di fuori si bussa)\n(interno)","translation":"(There is a knock outside.\nA voice from within.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":73,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Hello!… Hello! Hello!","translation":"Hello!... Hello! Hello!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":74,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(ha un sussulto)","translation":"(Minnie starts.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":75,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Wowkle, è già qui!","translation":"Wowkle, he's here already!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":76,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(Vede le calze tese sulla corda, le indica con un gesto irato a Wowkle: questa le strappa via e va a riporle in fretta nell’armadio di destra. Minnie corre al canterano, si guarda nello specchio, si acconcia febbrilmente le rose e lo scialle e poi rimane in una posizione imbarazzata presso il letto.)\n(compariste sulla porta con una lanterna in mano)","translation":"(She sees stockings drying on the line and angrily signals to Wowkle, who hastily pulls them down and hides them in the wardrobe. Minnie rushes to the mirror, feverishly adjusts roses and shawl, then stands awkwardly beside the bed.\nJohnson appears at the door carrying a lantern.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":77,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Hello!","translation":"Hello!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":78,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(vergognosa)","translation":"(Embarrassed.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":79,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Buona sera!","translation":"Good evening!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":80,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(osservandola)","translation":"(Looking at her.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":81,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Uscivate?","translation":"Were you going out?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":82,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(estremamente confusa)","translation":"(Extremely confused.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":83,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Si… No… Non so. Entrate.","translation":"Yes... No... I don't know. Come in."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":84,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(posa la lanterna sul tavolo vicino alla porta)","translation":"(He places the lantern on the table by the door.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":85,"sourcePage":26,"original":"Come siete graziosa!","translation":"How charming you look!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":86,"sourcePage":26,"original":"(fa l’atto d’abbracciarla; si volge verso Wowkle)","translation":"(He moves as if to embrace her, but turns and sees Wowkle.)"},{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":87,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Ugh!…","translation":"Ugh!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":88,"sourcePage":27,"original":"(Chiude la porta. Minnie si ritrae, aggrottando le sopracciglia)\n(A Minnie)","translation":"(The door closes. Minnie draws back and frowns.\nJohnson addresses Minnie.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":89,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Perdonate. Non avevo osservato…","translation":"Forgive me. I hadn't noticed..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":90,"sourcePage":27,"original":"(con aria offesa),","translation":"(Offended.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":91,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Basta così, signore:\nnon aggiungete scuse.","translation":"That's enough, sir;\ndon't make excuses."},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":92,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Mi siete apparsa così bella…","translation":"You looked so beautiful to me..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":93,"sourcePage":27,"original":"(ancora un poco risentita, sedendosi alla tavola dalla parte del focolare)","translation":"(Still somewhat offended, sitting at the table near the hearth.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":94,"sourcePage":27,"original":"È andare un po’ troppo per le corte.","translation":"That was rather too forward."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":95,"sourcePage":27,"original":"(avvicinandosele)","translation":"(Approaching her.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":96,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Vi prego scusare…","translation":"Please forgive me..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":97,"sourcePage":27,"original":"(seria)","translation":"(Seriously.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":98,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Siete pentito?","translation":"Do you regret it?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":99,"sourcePage":27,"original":"(scherzoso)","translation":"(Playfully.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":100,"sourcePage":27,"original":"No!","translation":"No!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":101,"sourcePage":27,"original":"(Minnie, che sta a capo chino, lo guarda di sotto in su, incontra il suo sguardo ed arrossisce. Wowkle spegne la lanterna di Johnson e la posa in terra, poi va ad accoccolarsi innanzi al focolare)","translation":"(Minnie raises her lowered head and looks at Johnson, meets his gaze and blushes. Wowkle extinguishes Johnson's lantern, sets it on the floor and crouches by the hearth.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":102,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Rimango?","translation":"May I stay?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":103,"sourcePage":27,"original":"(Minnie fa cenno di sì)","translation":"(Minnie nods.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":104,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Grazie.","translation":"Thank you."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":105,"sourcePage":27,"original":"(Depone il cappello sulla sedia accanto alla porta e si avvicina a Minnie, tendendole le mani)","translation":"(He places his hat on the chair by the door and approaches Minnie with outstretched hands.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":106,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Amici?","translation":"Friends?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":107,"sourcePage":27,"original":"(Minnie, vinta, sorride e gli stende la mano. Poi rimane in atteggiamento pensoso)","translation":"(Won over, Minnie smiles and offers him her hand, then becomes thoughtful.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":108,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Che pensate?","translation":"What are you thinking about?"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":109,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Un pensiero…\nQuesta notte alla “Polka” \nnon veniste per me…\nChe vi condusse, allora? Forse è vero\nche smarriste il sentiero\ndella Micheltorena?","translation":"A thought...\nLast night at the Polka,\nyou did not come for me...\nWhat brought you there, then?\nWas it true you had lost your\nway to Micheltorena's place?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":110,"sourcePage":27,"original":"(Johnson tenta di afferrarle le mani attraverso la tavola, come per sviare il discorso.)\nAlzandosi e scostandosi)","translation":"(Johnson tries to grasp her hands across the table, as though to change the subject.\nMinnie rises and moves away.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":111,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Wowkle, il caffè!","translation":"Wowkle, the coffee!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":112,"sourcePage":27,"original":"(guardandosi attorno)","translation":"(Looking around.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":113,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Che graziosa stanzetta!","translation":"What a delightful little room!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":114,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Vi piace?","translation":"Do you like it?"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":115,"sourcePage":27,"original":"E’ tutta piena di voi… Che cosa strana \nla vostra vita, su questa montagna\nsolitaria, lontana \ndal mondo!","translation":"The whole room is full of you...\nHow strange your life must be, on this lonely mountain,\nso far from\nthe world!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":116,"sourcePage":27,"original":"(con gaiezza)","translation":"(Cheerfully.)"}]},{"type":"Passage","listeningLandmark":true,"routeItem":3,"originalTitle":"Oh, se sapeste","translatedTitle":"Oh, if only you knew","threeLineOutline":true,"sourceTitlesOnly":true,"participants":["Minnie","Johnson"],"turns":[{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":117,"sourcePage":27,"original":"Oh, se sapeste\ncome il vivere è allegro!\nHo un piccolo polledro\nche mi porta a galoppo\nlaggiù per la campagna;\nper prati di giunchiglie,\ndi garofani ardenti,\nper riviere profonde\ncui profuman le sponde\ngelsomini e vaniglie!\nPoi ritorno ai miei pini,\nai monti della Sierra,\ncosì al cielo vicini\nche Iddio passando pare\nla sua mano v’inclini,\nlontani dalla terra\ncosì, che vien la voglia\ndi battere alla soglia\ndel cielo… per entrar!…","translation":"Oh,\nif only you knew how joyful life can be!\nI have\na little colt that\ncarries me galloping across the country,\nthrough meadows of daffodils\nand fiery carnations,\nalong deep rivers whose\nbanks are scented with jasmine and vanilla!\nThen I\nreturn to my pine trees\nand Sierra mountains,\nso near the sky that\nas God passes he\nseems to reach his hand toward them;\nso far\nfrom the earth that\none longs to knock\nupon heaven's door and enter!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":118,"sourcePage":28,"original":"(attento, sorpreso e interessato)","translation":"(Listening attentively, surprised and interested.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":119,"sourcePage":28,"original":"E quando infurian le tormente?","translation":"And when the storms rage?"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":120,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Oh, allora sono occupata.\nÈ aperta l’Accademia…","translation":"Oh, then I'm busy.\nThe Academy is open..."},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":121,"sourcePage":28,"original":"L’Accademia?","translation":"The Academy?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":122,"sourcePage":28,"original":"(ridendo)","translation":"(Laughing.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":123,"sourcePage":28,"original":"È la scuola dei minatori.","translation":"It's the miners' school."},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":124,"sourcePage":28,"original":"E la maestra?","translation":"And who is the teacher?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":125,"sourcePage":28,"original":"(sedendosi nuovamente)","translation":"(Sitting down again.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":126,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Io stessa.","translation":"I am."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":127,"sourcePage":28,"original":"(Johnson la guarda ammirato)\n(offrendogli il dolce)","translation":"(Johnson looks at her admiringly.\nMinnie offers him some dessert.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":128,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Del biscotto alla crema?","translation":"Would you like some cream biscuits?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":129,"sourcePage":28,"original":"(servendosi)","translation":"(Helping himself.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":130,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Grazie…\nVi piace leggere?","translation":"Thank you...\nDo you like reading?"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":131,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Molto.","translation":"Very much."},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":132,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Vi manderò dei libri.","translation":"I'll send you some books."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":133,"sourcePage":28,"original":"(Wowkle si rimette sul dorso la cuna portatile col bimbo)","translation":"(Wowkle straps the baby in its portable cradle onto her back.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":134,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Oh, grazie, grazie!\nDelle storie d’amore?","translation":"Oh, thank you,\nthank you! Love stories?"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":135,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Se volete. Vi piacciono?","translation":"If you wish. Do you like them?"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":136,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Sì! Tanto!","translation":"Yes! Very much!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":137,"sourcePage":28,"original":"(appassionatamente)","translation":"(Passionately.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":138,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Per me l’amore\nè una cosa infinita!\nNon potrò mai capire\ncome si possa, amando una persona\ndesiderarla per un’ora sola.","translation":"For me,\nlove is something infinite!\nI could never understand how\nanyone could love a person yet\ndesire them for only one hour."},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":139,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Credo che abbiate torto.\nVi sono delle donne\nche si vorrebber nella nostra vita\nper quell’ora soltanto… E poi morire!","translation":"I think you're wrong.\nThere are women one\nwould wish to have in one's life\nfor just that hour... and then die!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":140,"sourcePage":28,"original":"(scherzosa, piegandosi su lui)","translation":"(Playfully, bending over him.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":141,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Davvero? Quante volte siete morto?","translation":"Really? How many times have you died?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":142,"sourcePage":28,"original":"(offrendogli un sigaro)","translation":"(Offering him a cigar.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":143,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Uno dei nostri avana?","translation":"One of our Havana cigars?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":144,"sourcePage":28,"original":"(a Wowkle)","translation":"(To Wowkle.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":145,"sourcePage":28,"original":"La candela!","translation":"The candle!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":146,"sourcePage":28,"original":"(Wowkle porta la candela a Johnson che accende il sigaro, poi Johnson va verso Minnie cercando di abbracciarla.)\n(sfuggendogli)","translation":"(Wowkle brings Johnson a candle to light his cigar. He approaches Minnie, trying to embrace her;\nshe slips away.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":147,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Ah, le mie rose! Me le sciuperete!","translation":"Ah, my roses! You'll spoil them!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":148,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Perché non le togliete?","translation":"Why don't you take them off?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":149,"sourcePage":28,"original":"(cercando di cingere Minnie)","translation":"(Trying to put his arm around Minnie.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":150,"sourcePage":28,"original":"Un bacio, un bacio, un bacio solo!","translation":"A kiss, a kiss, just one kiss!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":151,"sourcePage":29,"original":"(sciogliendosi con dolce violenza)","translation":"(Gently but firmly freeing herself.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":152,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Mister Johnson, si chiede \nspesso la man… per avere il braccio!","translation":"Mr. Johnson, sometimes a man asks for a hand...\nwhen he means to take an arm!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":153,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Il labbro nega… \nquando il cuor… concede!","translation":"The lips refuse...\nwhen the heart consents!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":154,"sourcePage":29,"original":"(a poco a poco affascinata, si toglie le rose, le ripone nel cassetto coi guanti)","translation":"(Gradually enchanted, she removes her roses and puts them in the drawer with her gloves.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":155,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Wowkle, tu a casa!","translation":"Wowkle, go home!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":156,"sourcePage":29,"original":"(Wowkle borbottando si avvolge nella coperta avviandosi alla porta)\n(graziosa a Johnson che sta per avviarsi verso la porta)","translation":"(Muttering, Wowkle wraps herself in a blanket and heads for the door.\nMinnie turns charmingly to Johnson, who is about to leave.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":157,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Voi… potete restar\nun’ora… due… o più.","translation":"You... may stay an hour...\ntwo... or longer."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":158,"sourcePage":29,"original":"(aprendo la porta)","translation":"(Opening the door.)"}]},{"type":"Passage","listeningLandmark":true,"routeItem":4,"originalTitle":"Ugh… Neve!","translatedTitle":"Ugh… Snow!","threeLineOutline":true,"sourceTitlesOnly":true,"participants":["Wowkle","Minnie","Johnson"],"turns":[{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":159,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Ugh… Neve!","translation":"Ugh... Snow!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":160,"sourcePage":29,"original":"(nervosa)","translation":"(Nervously.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":161,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Va’! Ripòsati sul fieno.","translation":"Go on! Rest in the hay."},{"speaker":"WOWKLE","speakerTranslation":"Wowkle","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":162,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Ugh… Neve!","translation":"Ugh... Snow!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":163,"sourcePage":29,"original":"(Esce chiudendo dietro a sé la porta)\n(a Minnie, tendendole le braccia)","translation":"(Wowkle goes out and closes the door.\nJohnson holds out his arms to Minnie.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":164,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Un bacio. un bacio almen!","translation":"A kiss, at least one kiss!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":165,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Eccolo! È tuo!…","translation":"Here it is! It's yours!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":166,"sourcePage":29,"original":"(Si lancia nelle braccia di Johnson. – S’apre la porta, che sbatte violentemente a più riprese; tutto si agita al vento che entra furioso e raffiche di neve penetrano nella stanza. Minnie e Johnson abbracciandosi si baciano con grande emozione, dimentichi \ndi tutto e di tutti. - La porta si chiude da sé… cessa il tumulto, tutto ritornando alla calma; dal di fuori si odono ancora raffiche di vento)\n(con grande emozione)","translation":"(She throws herself into Johnson's arms. The door swings open and slams violently in the wind; everything trembles in the furious gusts, and flurries of snow enter. Minnie and Johnson kiss passionately,\nforgetting everyone and everything. The door closes by itself and calm returns, though the wind can still be heard outside.\nWith deep feeling.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":167,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Minnie… Che dolce nome!","translation":"Minnie... What a sweet name!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":168,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Ti piace?","translation":"Do you like it?"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":169,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Tanto! T’amo\nda che t’ho vista…","translation":"Very much!\nI've loved you since I first saw you..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":170,"sourcePage":29,"original":"(Ha un improvviso movimento come di raccapriccio, e si discosta da Minnie, come facendo forza a sé stesso)","translation":"(Suddenly horrified by his own words, he draws away as though mastering himself.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":171,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Ah, no, non mi guardare,\nnon m’ascoltare! Minnie, è un sogno vano!","translation":"Ah, no, don't look at me,\ndon't listen to me! Minnie, it's an empty dream!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":172,"sourcePage":29,"original":"(non comprendendo, con voce umile)","translation":"(Not understanding, in a humble voice.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":173,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Perché questa parola?\nSono una povera figliuola… lo so.\nMa quando t’ho incontrato mi son detta:\nEgli è perfetto; egli m’insegnerà.\nSe mi vorrà, m’avrà.","translation":"Why do you say that?\nI'm a poor girl, I know...\nBut when I met you, I said to myself: he is perfect;\nhe will teach me. If he wants me,\nI will be his."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":174,"sourcePage":29,"original":"(con subita risoluzione)","translation":"(With sudden determination.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":175,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Sii benedetta! Addio!","translation":"Bless you! Farewell!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":176,"sourcePage":29,"original":"(Bacia Minnie sulla bocca, corre alla porta e apre. – Una raffica di vento entra nella stanza)","translation":"(He kisses Minnie on the lips, runs to the door and opens it. A gust of wind enters.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":177,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Nevica!","translation":"It's snowing!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":178,"sourcePage":29,"original":"(Chiude la porta. Ritorna la calma)\n(corre alla finestra, trascinandoci Johnson e scosta la cortine; con accento incalzante)","translation":"(He closes the door; calm returns.\nMinnie runs to the window, dragging Johnson with her, draws back the curtain and speaks insistently.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":179,"sourcePage":29,"original":"Guarda! Il monte\nè tutto bianco : non c’è più sentier.\nper l’andar!","translation":"Look!\nThe mountain is all white: there is no path left\nto travel!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":180,"sourcePage":30,"original":"(agitatissimo)","translation":"(Extremely agitated.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":181,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Debbo!","translation":"I must go!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":182,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Perché? Domani t’apriranno la via!\nÈ il destino! Rimani!","translation":"Why? Tomorrow the road will open again!\nIt's fate! Stay!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":183,"sourcePage":30,"original":"(Colpi di revolver, rapidi)","translation":"(Rapid pistol shots.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":184,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Ascolta!","translation":"Listen!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":185,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Ascolta!\nForse è un bandito\nForse è Ramerrez! A noi che importa?","translation":"Listen!\nPerhaps it is a bandit—perhaps Ramerrez!\nWhat does it matter to us?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":186,"sourcePage":30,"original":"(trasalendo, cupamente)","translation":"(Starting violently, in a dark tone.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":187,"sourcePage":30,"original":"A noi che importa?…","translation":"What does it matter to us?..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":188,"sourcePage":30,"original":"(si slancia ancora verso l’uscita)\n(concitata)","translation":"(He rushes again toward the door.\nMinnie is agitated.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":189,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Resta! È destino!","translation":"Stay! It is fate!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":190,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Resto!\nMa, ti giuro…\nch’io non ti lascio più…","translation":"I'll stay!\nBut I swear to you...\nI will never leave you again..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":191,"sourcePage":30,"original":"(abbracciandola)","translation":"(Embracing her.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":192,"sourcePage":30,"original":"io non ti lascio più!\nMi stringo a te, confuso…\ncuore a cuor, sol con te!…","translation":"I will never leave you again!\nI hold you close, overwhelmed...\nheart to heart, with you alone!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON, MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Johnson, Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":193,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Dolce viver e morir…\ne non lasciarci più!","translation":"Sweet to live and die...\nand never part again!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":194,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Non lasciarci più!","translation":"Never part again!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":195,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Col bacio tuo fa’ puro il labbro mio!","translation":"Let your kiss make my lips pure!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":196,"sourcePage":30,"original":"(appassionatamente)","translation":"(Passionately.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":197,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Fammi, amor, degna di te!…","translation":"Love, make me worthy of you!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":198,"sourcePage":30,"original":"(con ardore intenso, incalzando)","translation":"(With intense, growing ardor.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":199,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Sai dirmi\nche sia questa soffrir?…","translation":"Can you\ntell me what this suffering is?"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":200,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Fammi, amor, degna di te!…","translation":"Love, make me worthy of you!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":201,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Non reggo più!… Ti voglio\nper me!","translation":"I can bear no more! I want you\nfor myself!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON, MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Johnson, Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":202,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Eternamente\nin estasi santa d’amor,\nverso la vita, \nsotto più fulgido ciel!\nAh, vivrem nella pace, \nvivremo di bontà!\nMia gioia, o amor! \nCon te, mio amor, con te!","translation":"Forever in\nthe sacred ecstasy of love,\ntoward life beneath a brighter sky!\nAh,\nwe shall live in peace,\nwe shall live in goodness!\nMy joy, my love!\nWith you, my love, with you!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":203,"sourcePage":30,"original":"(In un languore di desiderio, la invoca, l’allaccia a sé)","translation":"(Overcome with desire, he calls to her and embraces her.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":204,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Minnie! Minnie!","translation":"Minnie! Minnie!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":205,"sourcePage":30,"original":"(riscuotendosi, senza ripulsa)","translation":"(Coming back to herself, without rejecting him.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":206,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Sognavo…\nSi stava tanto bene!…\nOra conviene\ndarci la buona notte…","translation":"I was dreaming...\nIt was so wonderful!\nNow we\nhad better say good night..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":207,"sourcePage":30,"original":"(Johnson scuote il capo triste; si domina; Minnie gli accenna il letto)","translation":"(Johnson sadly shakes his head but masters himself. Minnie points to the bed.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":208,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Ecco il tuo letto…\nIo presso il focolare…","translation":"Here is your bed...\nI'll sleep by the fireplace..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":209,"sourcePage":30,"original":"(opponendosi)","translation":"(Protesting.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":210,"sourcePage":30,"original":"Non vorrò mai!","translation":"Never!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":211,"sourcePage":31,"original":"(subito)","translation":"(At once.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":212,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Ci sono avvezza, sai?\nQuasi ogni notte,\nquando fa troppo freddo, mi rannicchio\nin quella pelle d’orso e m’addormento.","translation":"I'm used to it,\nyou know.\nAlmost every night when it grows too cold,\nI curl up in that bearskin and fall asleep."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":213,"sourcePage":31,"original":"(Minnie cerca nell’armadio una coperta e un cuscino che posa sulla pelle d’orso vicino al focolare; abbassa la lampada sulla tavola, salendo su una sedia per giungervi; va dietro la guardaroba: si sveste, rimanendo con la lunga camicia bianca ricoperta da un ampio accappatoio di colore vivace; Johnson ha gettato sul letto la sua giacca e il cappello; estrae il revolver dalla custodia e lo pone, dopo averlo armato, sul cuscino; va a chiudere le cortine della finestra e si dispone a buttarsi sul letto, quando riappare Minnie)","translation":"(Minnie takes a blanket and pillow from the wardrobe and places them on the bearskin beside the hearth. She stands on a chair to lower the table lamp, then goes behind the wardrobe to undress, remaining in a long white nightdress under a brightly colored robe. Johnson puts his jacket and hat on the bed, takes his pistol out of its holster, cocks it and places it on the pillow. He closes the window curtains and is preparing to lie down when Minnie reappears.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":214,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Ora mi puoi parlare,\nlà, dalla tua cuccetta…","translation":"Now you can speak to me\nfrom your little bed over there..."},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":215,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Benedetta!","translation":"Bless you!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":216,"sourcePage":31,"original":"(Le getta un bacio. – Johnson fa per gettarsi sul letto; poi si avvicina all’uscio, origliando. – Minnie, dopo aver aggiustato i cuscini, calzate le pianelle indiane, s’inginocchia a pregare; si ravvolge nella coperta e si corica. Urli e venti)\n(sottovoce, vicino all’uscio)","translation":"(He blows her a kiss. As Johnson prepares to get into bed, he approaches the door to listen. Minnie arranges her cushions, puts on her soft shoes, kneels to pray, wraps herself in the blanket and lies down. Winds howl.\nJohnson speaks softly beside the door.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":217,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Che sarà?","translation":"What could that be?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":218,"sourcePage":31,"original":"(sottovoce)","translation":"(In a whisper.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":219,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Son folate di nevischio…","translation":"Just gusts of sleet..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":220,"sourcePage":31,"original":"(sottovoce)","translation":"(In a whisper.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":221,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Sembra gente che chiami…","translation":"It sounds like people calling..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":222,"sourcePage":31,"original":"(sottovoce)","translation":"(In a whisper.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":223,"sourcePage":31,"original":"È il vento dentro i rami…","translation":"It's the wind among the branches..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":224,"sourcePage":31,"original":"(Johnson ritorna al lettuccio e vi si getta sopra)\n(sorgendo un poco)","translation":"(Johnson returns to his little bed and lies down.\nMinnie rises slightly.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":225,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Dimmi il tuo nome…","translation":"Tell me your name..."},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":226,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Dick…","translation":"Dick..."},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":227,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Per sempre, Dick!","translation":"Forever, Dick!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":228,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Per sempre!","translation":"Forever!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":229,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Non conoscesti mai \nNina Micheltorena?","translation":"You never\nknew Nina Micheltorena?"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":230,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Mai.","translation":"Never."},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":231,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Buona notte!","translation":"Good night!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":232,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Buona notte!","translation":"Good night!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":233,"sourcePage":31,"original":"(di fuori)","translation":"(From outside.)"}]},{"type":"Passage","listeningLandmark":true,"routeItem":5,"originalTitle":"Hello!… Chiamano","translatedTitle":"Hello!… Someone is calling","threeLineOutline":true,"sourceTitlesOnly":true,"participants":["Nick","Minnie","Johnson","Sonora","Rance","Ashby"],"turns":[{"speaker":"NICK","speakerTranslation":"Nick","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":234,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Hello!","translation":"Hello!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":235,"sourcePage":31,"original":"(Durante tutta la scena il vento ora cresce, ora si queta, a folate. Minnie si alza, butta i cuscini nella guardaroba; si appressa all’uscio)\n(sommesso)","translation":"(Throughout the scene, the wind rises and falls in gusts. Minnie gets up, throws the cushions into the wardrobe and approaches the door.\nSoftly.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":236,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Chiamano…","translation":"Someone's calling..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":237,"sourcePage":31,"original":"(bussando alla porta)","translation":"(Knocking at the door.)"},{"speaker":"NICK","speakerTranslation":"Nick","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":238,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Hello!","translation":"Hello!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":239,"sourcePage":31,"original":"Chi sarà?","translation":"Who can it be?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":240,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(si alza, apre le cortine del letto e afferra il revolver)","translation":"(Johnson rises, pulls back the bed curtains and takes his pistol.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":241,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Non rispondere!","translation":"Don't answer!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":242,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(avanzandosi, impugnando il revolver)","translation":"(Advancing with pistol in hand.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":243,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Taci!","translation":"Be quiet!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":244,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(sottovoce)","translation":"(In a whisper.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":245,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Non farti sentire.\nÈ geloso, Jack Rance…","translation":"Don't let them hear you.\nIt's Jack Rance; he's jealous..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":246,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(dal di fuori)","translation":"(From outside.)"},{"speaker":"SONORA","speakerTranslation":"Sonora","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":247,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Hello!","translation":"Hello!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":248,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(dal di fuori)","translation":"(From outside.)"},{"speaker":"NICK","speakerTranslation":"Nick","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":249,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Hello!","translation":"Hello!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":250,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(forte)","translation":"(Loudly.)"},{"speaker":"NICK","speakerTranslation":"Nick","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":251,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Hanno veduto \nRamerrez sul sentiero…","translation":"They've seen\nRamerrez on the path..."},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":252,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Vengono a darmi aiuto?","translation":"Have they come to help me?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":253,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(Minnie spinge Johnson, riluttante, a nascondersi dietro le cortine del letto. Minnie apre: entrano Rance, Nick, Ashby, Sonora: Rance ha i calzoni dentro lo stivale alto e un elegante soprabito; Sonora ha il soprabito di bufalo; Ashby il soprabito sul vestito del primo atto; Nick dei pezzi di coperta ravvolti attorno le gambe; Nick e Ashby portano la lanterna. Sono coperti di neve: Rance va verso la tavola; Nick e Ashby lo seguono; Sonora è presso il focolare)","translation":"(Minnie pushes the reluctant Johnson behind the bed curtains. She opens the door. Rance, Nick, Ashby and Sonora enter, covered in snow. Rance wears his trousers tucked into high boots and an elegant overcoat; Sonora has a buffalo coat, Ashby an overcoat over his earlier clothes, and Nick has blanket strips wrapped round his legs. Nick and Ashby carry lanterns.)"},{"speaker":"SONORA","speakerTranslation":"Sonora","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":254,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Sei salva!… Io tremo tutto.","translation":"You're safe! I'm trembling all over."},{"speaker":"NICK","speakerTranslation":"Nick","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":255,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Abbiam passato un brutto \nquarto d’ora!…","translation":"We've been through a dreadful quarter\nof an hour!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":256,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(curiosa)","translation":"(Curiously.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":257,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Perché? Perché?","translation":"Why? Why?"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":258,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Temevamo per te…","translation":"We were afraid for you..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":259,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(curiosa)","translation":"(Curiously.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":260,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Per me?","translation":"For me?"},{"speaker":"ASHBY","speakerTranslation":"Ashby","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":261,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Quel vostro Johnson…","translation":"That Johnson of yours..."},{"speaker":"NICK","speakerTranslation":"Nick","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":262,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Lo straniero…","translation":"The stranger..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":263,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(con gioia velenosa)","translation":"(With malicious satisfaction.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":264,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Il tuo damo alla danza… era Ramerrez!","translation":"Your partner at the dance... was Ramerrez!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":265,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(colpita, stordita)","translation":"(Struck dumb with shock.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":266,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Che dite?! Che dite?! Che dite?!","translation":"What are you saying? What? What?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":267,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(scandendo bene le parole)","translation":"(Articulating every word.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":268,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Abbiamo detto\nche il tuo perfetto\nJohnson di Sacramento\nè un bandito da strada.","translation":"We said\nthat your perfect\nJohnson from Sacramento\nis a highwayman."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":269,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(con angoscia crescente, ribellandosi)","translation":"(Increasingly anguished, protesting.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":270,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Ah! Non è vero! Lo so,\nnon è ver!…","translation":"Ah! It's not true!\nI know it isn't true!"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":271,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Bada…\ndi non fidarti troppo un’altra volta.","translation":"Be\ncareful not to trust so blindly again."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":272,"sourcePage":32,"original":"(scattando)","translation":"(Starting angrily.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":273,"sourcePage":32,"original":"Non è vero! No! Mentite!","translation":"It's not true! No! You're lying!"},{"speaker":"ASHBY","speakerTranslation":"Ashby","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":274,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Questa notte alla “Polka”\nè venuto a rubare…","translation":"Tonight at the Polka he\ncame to rob us..."},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":275,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Ma non rubò!","translation":"But he didn't steal anything!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":276,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(riflettendo)","translation":"(Thinking.)"},{"speaker":"SONORA","speakerTranslation":"Sonora","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":277,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Non ha rubato, è vero…\nPure, avrebbe potuto!…","translation":"He didn't steal,\nthat's true... But he could have!"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":278,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Ha detto Nick che Sid l’ha veduto\nprender questo sentiero.\nÈ vero, Nick?","translation":"Nick said Sid saw him take this trail.\nIsn't that right,\nNick?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":279,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(Minnie lo fissa, Nick si turba)","translation":"(Minnie stares at Nick, who is troubled.)"},{"speaker":"NICK","speakerTranslation":"Nick","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":280,"sourcePage":33,"original":"È vero…","translation":"It's true..."},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":281,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Qui finisce la traccia.\nTu non l’hai visto…","translation":"The tracks end here.\nYou haven't seen him..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":282,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(guardando Minnie fissamente)","translation":"(Looking Minnie directly in the eye.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":283,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Dov’è dunque andato?","translation":"Where, then, has he gone?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":284,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(vedendo il resto d’un sigaro sul canterano; fra sé)","translation":"(Noticing a cigar end on the chest of drawers, to himself.)"},{"speaker":"NICK","speakerTranslation":"Nick","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":285,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(Uno dei nostri avana!)","translation":"(One of our Havanas!)"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":286,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(Minnie lo affissa)\n(fra sé)","translation":"(Minnie fixes him with a stare.\nTo himself.)"},{"speaker":"NICK","speakerTranslation":"Nick","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":287,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(È qui!…)","translation":"(He's here!)"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":288,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(con intenzione)","translation":"(Meaningfully.)"},{"speaker":"NICK","speakerTranslation":"Nick","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":289,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Forse ho sbagliato…\nQuel Sid è una linguaccia!","translation":"Perhaps I was mistaken...\nThat Sid is a gossip!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":290,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(alteramente)","translation":"(Proudly.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":291,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Ma chi vi ha detto, insomma,\nche il bandito sia Johnson?","translation":"But who told you, in the first place,\nthat Johnson is the bandit?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":292,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(guardandola)","translation":"(Looking at her.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":293,"sourcePage":33,"original":"La sua donna.","translation":"His woman."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":294,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(rapida, scattando)","translation":"(Quickly, starting up.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":295,"sourcePage":33,"original":"La sua donna? Chi?","translation":"His woman? Who?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":296,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(sogghignando)","translation":"(Sneering.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":297,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Nina.","translation":"Nina."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":298,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(subito)","translation":"(At once.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":299,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Nina Micheltorena?\nLo conosce?","translation":"Nina Micheltorena?\nDoes she know him?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":300,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(ironico)","translation":"(Ironically.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":301,"sourcePage":33,"original":"È l’amante.\nQuando capimmo d’essere giocati,\ntraemmo dietro Castro prigioniero,\ne prendemmo il sentier\nverso le “Palme”. Eravamo aspettati.","translation":"She's his lover.\nWhen we realized we had been tricked,\nwe dragged Castro along as our prisoner\nand took the road\nto the Palmes. They were waiting for us."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":302,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(Pausa)","translation":"(A pause.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":303,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Nina era là… Ci ha fatto\nvedere il suo ritratto…","translation":"Nina was there...\nShe showed us his portrait..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":304,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(mostrando il ritratto a Minnie)","translation":"(Showing Minnie the portrait.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":305,"sourcePage":33,"original":"A te!","translation":"Here!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":306,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(ridendo forte)","translation":"(Laughing loudly.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":307,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Ah! Ah!…","translation":"Ah! Ah!"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":308,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Di che ridi?","translation":"What are you laughing at?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":309,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(restituendo il ritratto)","translation":"(Returning the portrait.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":310,"sourcePage":33,"original":"Oh, di nulla, di nulla…","translation":"Oh, nothing, nothing..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":311,"sourcePage":33,"original":"(con grande ironia)","translation":"(With great irony.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":312,"sourcePage":33,"original":"La compagnia gentile\nch’egli si è scelto! Nina!","translation":"What fine company he keeps!\nNina!"},{"speaker":"SONORA","speakerTranslation":"Sonora","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":313,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Impara!","translation":"Let that teach you!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":314,"sourcePage":34,"original":"(con calma simulata)","translation":"(With feigned calm.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":315,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Ora, ragazzi,\nè tardi… Buona notte.","translation":"Well, boys,\nit's late... Good night."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":316,"sourcePage":34,"original":"(dolce)","translation":"(Gently.)"},{"speaker":"SONORA","speakerTranslation":"Sonora","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":317,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Ti lasciamo dormire.","translation":"We'll let you sleep."},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":318,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Grazie. Ora son calma.","translation":"Thank you. I'm calm now."},{"speaker":"ASHBY","speakerTranslation":"Ashby","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":319,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Andiamo.","translation":"Let's go."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":320,"sourcePage":34,"original":"(si avviano tutti)\n(a Minnie)","translation":"(They all start to leave.\nNick speaks to Minnie.)"},{"speaker":"NICK","speakerTranslation":"Nick","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":321,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Se lo volete… io resto.","translation":"If you wish... I'll stay."},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":322,"sourcePage":34,"original":"No. Buona notte.","translation":"No. Good night."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":323,"sourcePage":34,"original":"(uscendo)","translation":"(Going out.)"},{"speaker":"ASHBY","speakerTranslation":"Ashby","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":324,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Buona notte.","translation":"Good night."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":325,"sourcePage":34,"original":"(Escono tutti)\n(Con grande disprezzo, rivolta a Johnson)","translation":"(They all leave.\nMinnie turns toward Johnson with utter contempt.)"}]},{"type":"Passage","listeningLandmark":true,"routeItem":6,"originalTitle":"Vieni fuori!","translatedTitle":"Come out!","threeLineOutline":true,"sourceTitlesOnly":true,"participants":["Minnie","Johnson"],"turns":[{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":326,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Vieni fuori! Vieni fuori! Vieni fuori!","translation":"Come out! Come out! Come out!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":327,"sourcePage":34,"original":"(Johnson appare tra le cortine, vinto, disfatto)","translation":"(Johnson emerges from the curtains, defeated and devastated.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":328,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Sei venuto a rubare!","translation":"You came here to steal!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":329,"sourcePage":34,"original":"No…","translation":"No..."},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":330,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Mentisci!","translation":"You lie!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":331,"sourcePage":34,"original":"No!","translation":"No!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":332,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Si!","translation":"Yes!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":333,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Tutto m’accusa… Ma…","translation":"Everything condemns me... But..."},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":334,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Finisci!\nDimmi perché sei qui,\nse non è per rubare?","translation":"Go on!\nTell me why you are\nhere if not to steal!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":335,"sourcePage":34,"original":"(deciso, avvicinandosi a Minnie )","translation":"(Decisively, approaching Minnie.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":336,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Ma quando io v’ho veduta…","translation":"But when I saw you..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":337,"sourcePage":34,"original":"(trattenendolo con gesto secco)","translation":"(Stopping him with a sharp gesture.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":338,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Adagio, adagio!… Non muovere un passo… \no chiamo aiuto! Un bandito! un bandito!…","translation":"Slowly, slowly! Don't move a step or\nI'll call for help! A bandit! A bandit!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":339,"sourcePage":34,"original":"(con sorda ironia)","translation":"(With dark irony.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":340,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Ah! ah! Son fortunata! Un bandito! un bandito!","translation":"Ha, ha! How lucky I am! A bandit! A bandit!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":341,"sourcePage":34,"original":"(sdegnosa e violenta)","translation":"(Indignant and violent.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":342,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Puoi andartene! Va’!…\nVa’, va’, va’!","translation":"You can go! Go!\nGo, go, go!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":343,"sourcePage":34,"original":"(Va alla porta per aprirla; Johnson la trattiene d’un gesto)","translation":"(She goes to open the door; Johnson stops her with a gesture.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":344,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Una parola sola!\nNon mi difenderò… sono un dannato!","translation":"Just one word!\nI shall not defend myself... I am a damned man!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":345,"sourcePage":34,"original":"(Minnie si avvicina lentamente alla tavola, si lascia cadere accasciata su una sedia e nasconde il viso nelle braccia appoggiate alla tavola.)","translation":"(Minnie slowly approaches the table, collapses into a chair and hides her face in her arms.)"}]},{"type":"Passage","listeningLandmark":true,"routeItem":7,"originalTitle":"Lo so, lo so! Ma non vi avrei rubato!","translatedTitle":"I know, I know! But I would not have robbed you!","threeLineOutline":true,"sourceTitlesOnly":true,"participants":["Johnson","Minnie"],"turns":[{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":346,"sourcePage":34,"original":"Lo so, lo so! Ma non vi avrei rubato!\nSono Ramerrez: nacqui vagabondo\nera ladro il mio nome\nda quando venni al mondo.\nMa fino che visse\nmio padre, io non sapevo.\nQuando, or sono sei mesi\nche mio padre morì…\nSola ricchezza mia,\nper la madre e i fratelli, alla dimane,\nl’eredità paterna: una masnada\ndi banditi da strada!","translation":"I know, I know! But I would not\nhave robbed you! I am Ramerrez.\nI was born a wanderer;\nthief was my name from\nthe moment I came\ninto the world.\nBut as long as my father lived,\nI knew nothing of it.\nSix months ago,\nwhen he died, my only inheritance, meant to provide\nfor my mother and brothers,\nwas a gang of highway robbers!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":347,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(triste)","translation":"(Sadly.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":348,"sourcePage":35,"original":"L’accettai.\nEra quello il destino mio!\nMa un giorno\nv’ho incontrata…","translation":"I accepted it.\nThat was my fate!\nBut one day\nI met you..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":349,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(Minnie rialza la testa, senza guardare Johnson, rimanendo come assorta nella visione della felicità perduta)","translation":"(Minnie raises her head but does not look at Johnson, lost in a vision of lost happiness.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":350,"sourcePage":35,"original":"Ho sognato\nd’andarmene con voi tanto lontano,\nper redimermi tutto in una vita\ndi lavoro e d’amore… E il labbro mio\nmormorò una preghiera ardente: Oh Dio!\nch’ella non sappia mai la mia vergogna!\nIl sogno è stato vano!\nOra ho finito…","translation":"I dreamed\nof going far away with you,\nof redeeming myself in a life\nof work and love... And my lips\nwhispered a fervent prayer: O God,\nlet her never know my shame! The dream was vain!\nNow I have\ntold you everything..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":351,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(commossa, senza asprezza, guardando fissamente Johnson)","translation":"(Moved, without harshness, looking straight at Johnson.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":352,"sourcePage":35,"original":"Che voi siate un bandito…\nve lo perdoni Iddio.","translation":"May God forgive you\nfor being a bandit."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":353,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(con grande amarezza)","translation":"(With deep bitterness.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":354,"sourcePage":35,"original":"Ma il primo bacio mio vi siete preso,\nché vi credevo mio, soltanto mio.\nAndate, andate!…","translation":"But you took my first kiss because\nI believed you were mine,\nmine alone. Go, go!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":355,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(Dice queste parole macchinalmente, alzandosi disfatta, cercando di farsi forza)","translation":"(She speaks mechanically, rising in despair and trying to summon strength.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":356,"sourcePage":35,"original":"V’uccideranno… Che m’importa!","translation":"They'll kill you... What do I care!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":357,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(disperato, deciso, senz’armi, apre la porta, pronto al sacrificio, come a un suicidio)","translation":"(Desperate and resolute, unarmed, Johnson opens the door, ready to sacrifice himself as though by suicide.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":358,"sourcePage":35,"original":"Addio!","translation":"Farewell!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":359,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(esce precipitosamente)\n(rasciugandosi le lagrime)","translation":"(He rushes out.\nMinnie wipes away her tears.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":360,"sourcePage":35,"original":"È finita… Finita!","translation":"It's over... Over!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":361,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(Colpo di revolver, interno)\n(ascoltando)","translation":"(A pistol shot is heard outside.\nMinnie listens.)"}]},{"type":"Passage","listeningLandmark":true,"routeItem":8,"originalTitle":"L’han ferito…","translatedTitle":"They have wounded him…","threeLineOutline":true,"sourceTitlesOnly":true,"participants":["Minnie","Johnson"],"turns":[{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":362,"sourcePage":35,"original":"L’han ferito…","translation":"They've wounded him..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":363,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(con uno sforzo supremo su se stessa)","translation":"(Summoning the utmost effort of self-control.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":364,"sourcePage":35,"original":"Che importa?","translation":"What does it matter?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":365,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(Va all’uscio, inquieta; ritorna; va al canterano e scoppia in lacrime, reclinando la testa sulle braccia. – Si ode la caduta di Johnson presso la porta, che viene scossa dall’urto. – Minnie ha un grido angoscioso e represso; poi corre ad aprire; Johnson è steso a terra, ferito)\n(con voce soffocata)","translation":"(Uneasy, she goes to the door, returns, then breaks into tears at the chest of drawers, burying her face in her arms. Johnson falls against the door with a thud. Minnie suppresses an anguished cry, runs to open it and finds him wounded on the ground. He speaks in\na stifled voice.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":366,"sourcePage":35,"original":"Non chiudete la porta…","translation":"Don't close the door..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":367,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(Minnie lo attira, aiutandolo ad entrare)","translation":"(Minnie draws him in and helps him enter.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":368,"sourcePage":35,"original":"Debbo uscire…","translation":"I must go out..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":369,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(resistendo)","translation":"(Resisting.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":370,"sourcePage":35,"original":"No!","translation":"No!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":371,"sourcePage":35,"original":"Entra!","translation":"Come in!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":372,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(resistendo)","translation":"(Resisting.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":373,"sourcePage":35,"original":"No!","translation":"No!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":374,"sourcePage":35,"original":"Entra!…","translation":"Come in!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":375,"sourcePage":35,"original":"Non chiudete, no!…","translation":"Don't close it, no!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":376,"sourcePage":35,"original":"Entra!","translation":"Come in!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":377,"sourcePage":35,"original":"No!","translation":"No!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":378,"sourcePage":35,"original":"(trascinandolo disperata)","translation":"(Desperately dragging him inside.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":379,"sourcePage":35,"original":"Entra!","translation":"Come in!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":380,"sourcePage":36,"original":"No!","translation":"No!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":381,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Sta qui…\nSei ferito… Nasconditi qui!","translation":"Stay here...\nYou're wounded... Hide here!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":382,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(chiude la porta)","translation":"(She closes the door.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":383,"sourcePage":36,"original":"No!","translation":"No!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":384,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(con angoscia)","translation":"(In anguish.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":385,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Sei ferito!\nNasconditi… nasconditi!","translation":"You're wounded!\nHide yourself, hide!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":386,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Aprite la porta… voglio, voglio uscir!","translation":"Open the door... I want, I want to go out!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":387,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Resta!","translation":"Stay!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":388,"sourcePage":36,"original":"No!…","translation":"No!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":389,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(con sentimento d’angoscia)","translation":"(With anguish.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":390,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Io t’amo, resta, resta…","translation":"I love you, stay, stay..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":391,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(con grande anima)","translation":"(With all her soul.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":392,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Ah! Sei l’uomo che baciai la prima volta…\nNon puoi morir!","translation":"Ah! You're the man I kissed for the first time...\nYou cannot die!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":393,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(Sale su di una sedia, toglie dal gancio la scala a piuoli, la lascia cadere a terra)","translation":"(She climbs onto a chair, unhooks the ladder to the loft and lets it fall to the ground.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":394,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Su, su, su, presto!","translation":"Up, up, quickly!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":395,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(resistendo)","translation":"(Resisting.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":396,"sourcePage":36,"original":"No!…","translation":"No!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":397,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(aiutandolo a salire)","translation":"(Helping him climb.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":398,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Su, sàlvati!…","translation":"Up! Save yourself!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":399,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(quasi mancando)","translation":"(Nearly collapsing.)"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":400,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Non posso più…","translation":"I can go no farther..."},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":401,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Su, su, su, sàlvati…\nPoi verrai con me.\nLontano!","translation":"Up, up, save yourself...\nThen you'll go away with me.\nFar away!"},{"speaker":"JOHNSON","speakerTranslation":"Johnson","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":402,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Non posso più…","translation":"I can't go any farther..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":403,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(aiutandolo ancora)","translation":"(Helping him again.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":404,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Così… Lo puoi, lo devi…\nCoraggio, su… T’amo, t’amo!\nSu! su!","translation":"There... You can, you must... Courage,\ncome on... I love you, I love you!\nUp! Up!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":405,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(Johnson si lascia cadere affranto sul solaio. – Si bussa al di fuori con forza… più forte. – Minnie discende, rialza in fretta la scala, l’aggancia; rimane un po’ titubante e poi va ad aprire. – Apre la porta. – Rance entra cautamente con la pistola spianata esplorando ogni angolo).","translation":"(Exhausted, Johnson collapses in the loft. Outside there is a loud knock, then louder still. Minnie climbs down, quickly raises and hooks the ladder, hesitates, then opens the door. Rance enters cautiously, aiming his pistol and searching every corner.)"}]},{"type":"Passage","listeningLandmark":true,"routeItem":9,"originalTitle":"Che c’è di nuovo, Jack?","translatedTitle":"What is new, Jack?","threeLineOutline":true,"sourceTitlesOnly":true,"participants":["Minnie","Rance"],"turns":[{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":406,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Che c’è di nuovo, Jack?","translation":"What's new, Jack?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":407,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(volgendosi, severo, imperioso)","translation":"(Turning to her, stern and commanding.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":408,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Non sono Jack… Son lo Sceriffo, a caccia\ndel tuo Johnson d’inferno.\nN’ho seguito la traccia.\nDev’esser qui. Dov’è?","translation":"I'm not Jack... I'm the sheriff,\nhunting that damned Johnson of yours.\nI followed his tracks. He must be here.\nWhere is he?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":409,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(aspramente)","translation":"(Sharply.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":410,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Ah, mi avete seccato\ncon questo vostro Ramerrez!","translation":"Ah, I'm sick of hearing\nyou go on about this Ramerrez!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":411,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(spianando la pistola verso il letto e avanzando)","translation":"(Advancing and aiming his pistol at the bed.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":412,"sourcePage":36,"original":"È là!\nNon c’è…","translation":"He's there!\nNo, he isn't..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":413,"sourcePage":36,"original":"(impazientito)","translation":"(Impatiently.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":414,"sourcePage":36,"original":"Ma l’ho ferito,\nperdio, ne sono certo!\nNon può esser fuggito!\nNon può esser che qua.","translation":"But I wounded him,\nby God, I'm certain!\nHe couldn't have escaped!\nHe can only be here."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":415,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(sempre più aspra)","translation":"(Growing more and more angry.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":416,"sourcePage":37,"original":"E cercatelo, dunque! Rovistate\ndove vi pare, e poi\nlevatevi dai piedi\nuna volta per sempre!","translation":"Then search for him! Turn over everything\nwherever you please,\nand afterward get out of my\nway once and for all!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":417,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(con un sussulto, abbassando la pistola)","translation":"(Starting, he lowers his pistol.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":418,"sourcePage":37,"original":"Mi giuri che non c’è?","translation":"Do you swear he's not here?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":419,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(beffarda)","translation":"(Mockingly.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":420,"sourcePage":37,"original":"Perché non seguitate \na cercarlo?","translation":"Why don't you\nkeep searching?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":421,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(si guarda attorno, guarda Minnie, poi ripone la pistola in tasca, si leva il mantello e il berretto e li pone su una sedia vicino alla tavola) ","translation":"(He looks around and at Minnie, then puts away his pistol, removes his overcoat and cap, and lays them on a chair beside the table.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":422,"sourcePage":37,"original":"E sarà! L’avrò sbagliato…","translation":"Well then! Perhaps I was mistaken..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":423,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(volgendosi a Minnie con impeto improvviso)","translation":"(Turning suddenly toward Minnie with passion.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":424,"sourcePage":37,"original":"Ma dimmi che non l’ami!…","translation":"But tell me you don't love him!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":425,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(sprezzante)","translation":"(With contempt.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":426,"sourcePage":37,"original":"Siete pazzo!","translation":"You're mad!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":427,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(avvicinandosi, pallido, tremante)","translation":"(Approaching, pale and trembling.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":428,"sourcePage":37,"original":"Lo vedi!\nSono pazzo di te!… T’amo, ti voglio!…","translation":"You see!\nI'm mad for you! I love you, I want you!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":429,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(L’abbraccia violentemente cercando di baciarla)\n(svincolandosi)","translation":"(He seizes her violently, trying to kiss her.\nShe struggles free.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":430,"sourcePage":37,"original":"Vigliacco!","translation":"Coward!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":431,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(rincorrendola)","translation":"(Chasing her.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":432,"sourcePage":37,"original":"Ti voglio!","translation":"I want you!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":433,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(afferrando una bottiglia e minacciandolo sulla testa)","translation":"(She seizes a bottle and threatens to strike him over the head.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":434,"sourcePage":37,"original":"Vigliacco!\nAh! Via di qua, vigliacco!… \nEsci, vigliacco, esci!\nVia di qua, via di qua!","translation":"Coward! Ah,\nget out of here, coward!\nGo out, coward, get out!\nGet out, get out!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":435,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(incalza Rance verso l’uscita)\n(indietreggia con atto minaccioso, fermandosi sotto il ballatoio; si avvicina al tavolo, prende il mantello e il berretto e si avvia verso l’uscita)","translation":"(She drives Rance toward the door.\nHe retreats threateningly, stopping beneath the loft, then approaches the table, picks up his coat and cap and heads toward the exit.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":436,"sourcePage":37,"original":"Sei fiera! L’ami! Vuoi \nserbarti a lui… Sì, vado.","translation":"You are proud! You love him!\nYou want to save yourself for him... Yes, I'm going."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":437,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(stende una mano verso Minnie; una stilla di sangue, gocciando dal solaio, gli cade sulla mano. Egli si sofferma, stupito)","translation":"(He extends a hand toward Minnie. A drop of blood falls onto it from the loft. He stops in astonishment.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":438,"sourcePage":37,"original":"Ma ti giuro…\nche non ti avrà!…\nOh, strano!\nDel sangue sulla mano…","translation":"But I swear...\nyou won't have him!\nHow strange!\nBlood on my hand..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":439,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(con voce tremante)","translation":"(In a trembling voice.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":440,"sourcePage":37,"original":"Forse v’avrò graffiato!…","translation":"Perhaps I scratched you!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":441,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(serio)","translation":"(Seriously.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":442,"sourcePage":37,"original":"No, non c’è graffio… Guarda!…","translation":"No, there's no scratch... Look!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":443,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(asciugandosi la mano col fazzoletto sul quale, dal solaio, cadono ancora goccie di sangue)","translation":"(He wipes his hand with his handkerchief, onto which more drops of blood fall from the loft.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":444,"sourcePage":37,"original":"… e sangue ancora!…","translation":"...more blood!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":445,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(guardando il solaio – poi con un grido di gioia e d’odio, come avventandosi)","translation":"(Looking toward the loft, then crying out with joy and hatred, as though leaping upon his prey.)"}]},{"type":"Passage","listeningLandmark":true,"routeItem":10,"originalTitle":"È là! È là!","translatedTitle":"He is there! He is there!","threeLineOutline":true,"sourceTitlesOnly":true,"participants":["Rance","Minnie"],"turns":[{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":446,"sourcePage":37,"original":"È là! è là!","translation":"He's there! He's there!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":447,"sourcePage":37,"original":"(opponendosi a Rance con tutte le sue forze)","translation":"(Minnie opposes Rance with all her strength.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":448,"sourcePage":37,"original":"Ah, no… non voglio!","translation":"Ah, no... I won't let you!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":449,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(cercando sciogliersi dalla stretta di Minnie)","translation":"(Trying to break free of Minnie's grip.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":450,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Lasciami!","translation":"Let me go!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":451,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Ah! no! no! non voglio!","translation":"Ah, no! No, I won't let you!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":452,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(si attacca con violenza a Rance.)","translation":"(She clings violently to Rance.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":453,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Non voglio!","translation":"I won't!"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":454,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Lasciami!","translation":"Let me go!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":455,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(gridando)","translation":"(Shouting.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":456,"sourcePage":38,"original":"No!","translation":"No!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":457,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(Johnson dal ballatoio si trascina verso la botola e con la faccia esterrefatta segue l’azione fra Minnie e Rance)\n(brutalmente si svincola dalla stretta di Minnie e la getta a terra)","translation":"(Johnson drags himself toward the trapdoor in the loft and watches the struggle in horror.\nRance brutally tears himself free and throws Minnie to the floor.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":458,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Lasciami!","translation":"Let me go!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":459,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(gridando)","translation":"(Shouting.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":460,"sourcePage":38,"original":"No! no!","translation":"No! No!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":461,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(imperioso, rivolto verso il solaio)","translation":"(Commandingly, addressing the loft.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":462,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Mister Johnson, scendete!","translation":"Mister Johnson, come down!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":463,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(Sale su di una scala, abbassa la scala del solaio e vi si pone di faccia con la pistola puntata)\n(disperata, trascinandosi a ginocchi)","translation":"(Rance climbs onto a chair, lowers the loft ladder and faces Johnson with his pistol aimed at him.\nMinnie crawls toward him on her knees in despair.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":464,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Aspettate, aspettate,\nnon può, non può,\nvedete, non può, no!","translation":"Wait, wait, he can't,\nhe can't... Can't you see?\nHe can't, no!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":465,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(Johnson con uno sforzo supremo comincia a discendere pallido e sofferente, ma con volto fiero)\n(impaziente)","translation":"(With an immense effort Johnson begins to descend, pale and suffering but proud.\nRance grows impatient.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":466,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Scendete, \no perdio…","translation":"Come down,\nor by God..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":467,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(smarrita, implorante)","translation":"(Distraught, pleading.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":468,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Un minuto, Rance! Un minuto ancora!","translation":"One minute, Rance! Just one more minute!"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":469,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Un minuto? e perché?","translation":"One minute? And why?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":470,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(ridendo forte)","translation":"(Laughing loudly.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":471,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Ah, ah, che mutamento!…","translation":"Ha, ha, what a change!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":472,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(Johnson, aiutato da Minnie, ha disceso gli ultimi scalini, si trascina verso il tavolo)","translation":"(Helped by Minnie, Johnson descends the last rungs and drags himself toward the table.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":473,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Volete ancor giuocare\nla partita con me,\nsignor di Sacramento?\nLascio la scelta a voi\na corda od a pistola!","translation":"Would you like another\ngame with me,\ngentleman from Sacramento?\nYou can choose a\nrope or a pistol!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":474,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(Johnson si siede di peso sulla sedia, appoggia i gomiti sul tavolo, vi abbandona sopra il capo. È svenuto)\n(violenta)","translation":"(Johnson drops heavily into a chair, rests his elbows on the table and lets his head fall forward. He has fainted.\nMinnie becomes violent.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":475,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Basta, uomo d’inferno!\nVedetelo: è svenuto.\nNon può darvi più ascolto…","translation":"Enough, you devil of a man!\nLook, he's fainted.\nHe cannot listen to you anymore..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":476,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(disperata si preme le tempie colle mani, come per cercare un’ispirazione, poi si avvicina a Rance e lo guarda, cogli occhi negli occhi; con voce secca e concitata)","translation":"(Desperate, Minnie presses her hands to her temples as though searching for an idea. Then she goes to Rance and looks him straight in the eyes, speaking sharply and quickly.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":477,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Parliamoci fra noi… E si finisca!\nChi siete voi, Jack Rance? Un biscazziere.\nE Johnson? Un bandito.","translation":"Let's settle it between ourselves and have done!\nWho are you, Jack Rance? A gambler.\nAnd Johnson? A bandit."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":478,"sourcePage":38,"original":"(sguaiatamente)","translation":"(Coarsely.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":479,"sourcePage":38,"original":"Io? Padrona di bettola e di bisca\nvivo sul whisky e l’oro,\nTutti del pari!\nTutti banditi e bari!\nStanotte avete chiesto una risposta\nalla vostra passione…\nEccovi la mia posta!","translation":"And me? The mistress of a saloon\nand gambling den;\nI live on whisky and gold.\nWe're all the same!\nAll thieves and cheats! Tonight you asked\nme to answer your passion...\nHere is my stake!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":480,"sourcePage":39,"original":"(studiandola)","translation":"(Studying her.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":481,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Che vuoi dire?","translation":"What do you mean?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":482,"sourcePage":39,"original":"(affannosamente)","translation":"(Breathlessly.)"}]},{"type":"Passage","listeningLandmark":true,"routeItem":11,"originalTitle":"Una partita a poker!","translatedTitle":"A game of poker!","threeLineOutline":true,"sourceTitlesOnly":true,"participants":["Minnie","Rance"],"turns":[{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":483,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Ch’io v’offro\nquest’uomo e la mia vita!…\nUna partita a poker!\nSe vincete, prendetevi\nquesto ferito e me…\nMa se vinco, parola\ndi Jack Rance,\nè mio quest’uomo!… Ah… è mio!","translation":"I offer you\nthis man and my own life!\nA game of poker!\nIf you win,\ntake this wounded man and me...\nBut if I win,\non Jack Rance's word,\nthis man is mine! Ah, mine!"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":484,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Come l’ami! come l’ami!\nAccetto, sì! T’avrò, t’avrò!","translation":"How you love him! How you love him!\nI accept, yes! I'll have you, I'll have you!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":485,"sourcePage":39,"original":"La parola?…","translation":"Your word?"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":486,"sourcePage":39,"original":"So perdere come un signore… Ma perdio!…\nson tutto della sete di te arso e distrutto…\nma se vinco, t’avrò…","translation":"I know how to lose like a gentleman... But by God!\nI'm consumed and destroyed by thirst for you... If I win,\nyou will be mine..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":487,"sourcePage":39,"original":"(Rance siede al tavolo, getta a terra la tovaglia, prende dalla tasca dell’abito un giuoco di carte e comincia a mischiarle. – Minnie si ritrae con un senso di repulsione, va verso l’armadio e vi si indugia. Si vede che furtivamente si nasconde qualche cosa in una calza)\n(impaziente)","translation":"(Rance sits at the table, throws the cloth to the floor, takes a pack of cards from his coat and begins shuffling. Minnie draws back in revulsion, goes toward the wardrobe and pauses there. She furtively hides something inside a stocking.\nRance is impatient.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":488,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Che aspetti?","translation":"What are you waiting for?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":489,"sourcePage":39,"original":"(indugiando)","translation":"(Hesitating.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":490,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Cercavo un mazzo nuovo…","translation":"I was looking for a new pack..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":491,"sourcePage":39,"original":"(avanzandosi, avvicinandosi al tavolo e deponendovi il suo mazzo di carte)","translation":"(Coming forward and placing her cards on the table.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":492,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Son nervosa \nscusatemi.","translation":"I'm nervous,\nforgive me."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":493,"sourcePage":39,"original":"(Rance mette da parte le sue carte, piglia quelle di Minnie, le mischia, ne alza una e fa cenno a Minnie \ndi fare altrettanto per vedere chi dovrà prima dare le carte – la sorte favorisce Rance)","translation":"(Rance puts his own cards aside, takes Minnie's, shuffles them, cuts a card and gestures to Minnie\nto do likewise in order to decide who will deal first. Fortune favors Rance.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":494,"sourcePage":39,"original":"È una cosa terribile \npensar che una partita \ndecide d’una vita.","translation":"It's terrible to think\nthat a game of cards\ncan decide a life."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":495,"sourcePage":39,"original":"(si siede al tavolo in faccia a Rance)","translation":"(She sits opposite Rance.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":496,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Siete pronto?","translation":"Are you ready?"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":497,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Son pronto. Taglia. A te.","translation":"I'm ready. Cut. Your turn."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":498,"sourcePage":39,"original":"(Giocano)","translation":"(They play.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":499,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Due mani sopra tre.","translation":"Two hands out of three."},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":500,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Quante?","translation":"How many?"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":501,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Due…","translation":"Two..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":502,"sourcePage":39,"original":"(Rance dà le carte)","translation":"(Rance deals.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":503,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Che ha \nche tu l’adori?","translation":"What is it\nabout him that makes you adore him?"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":504,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Voi che trovate in me?…","translation":"And what do you find in me?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":505,"sourcePage":39,"original":"(I due giocatori guardano ansiosi le proprie carte)\n(mostrando il gioco)","translation":"(Both players anxiously inspect their cards.\nMinnie shows her hand.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":506,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Che avete?","translation":"What have you got?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":507,"sourcePage":39,"original":"(mostrando il gioco)","translation":"(Showing his hand.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":508,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Io re.","translation":"I have a king."},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":509,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Io re.","translation":"I have a king."},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":510,"sourcePage":39,"original":"Fante.","translation":"Jack."},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":511,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Regina.","translation":"Queen."},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":512,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Hai vinto.\nAlla mano seguente!","translation":"You have won.\nOn to the next hand!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":513,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(Minnie piglia il mazzo di carte, lo mischia, fa tagliare a Rance e poi dà le carte. – Minnie dà una carta a Rance, guarda il proprio gioco e piglia cinque carte)","translation":"(Minnie takes the pack, shuffles it, has Rance cut and then deals. She deals one card to Rance, looks at her hand and takes five cards.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":514,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Quante?","translation":"How many?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":515,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(dando carte a Rance)","translation":"(Dealing to Rance.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":516,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Una…","translation":"One..."},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":517,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Due…","translation":"Two..."},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":518,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Due assi e un paio…","translation":"Two aces and a pair..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":519,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(mostrando il suo gioco, con voce spenta)","translation":"(Showing her cards, in a faint voice.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":520,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Niente!","translation":"Nothing!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":521,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(con gioia)","translation":"(Joyfully.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":522,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Pari! Siam pari! Evviva!","translation":"A tie! We're even! Hurrah!"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":523,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Ora è la decisiva?","translation":"Is this the deciding hand?"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":524,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Si.","translation":"Yes."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":525,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(Rance mischia le carte e poi le dà da tagliare a Minnie)","translation":"(Rance shuffles the cards and offers the pack to Minnie to cut.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":526,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Taglia!","translation":"Cut!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":527,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(cercando raddolcirlo)","translation":"(Trying to soften him.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":528,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Rance, mi duole","translation":"Rance, I am sorry"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":529,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(mentre taglia le carte)","translation":"(As she cuts the cards.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":530,"sourcePage":40,"original":"delle amare parole…","translation":"for my bitter words..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":531,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(acceso)","translation":"(With heat.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":532,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Scarta.","translation":"Discard."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":533,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(Minnie scarta due carte; Rance le dà due carte e ne piglia tre per sé)","translation":"(Minnie discards two cards; Rance gives her two and takes three himself.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":534,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Ho sempre pensato\nbene di voi, Jack Rance…\ne sempre penserò…","translation":"I have always thought\nwell of you,\nJack Rance... and always will..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":535,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(certo ormai della vittoria)","translation":"(Now certain of victory.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":536,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Io penso solamente che ti avrò\nfra le mie braccia.","translation":"All I can think is that I shall\nhold you in my arms."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":537,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(I due giocatori guardano le proprie carte: Rance esulta)","translation":"(They look at their cards; Rance exults.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":538,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Tre re! Vedi: ti vinco!","translation":"Three kings! You see, I've beaten you!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":539,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(come se stesse per svenire)","translation":"(As though about to faint.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":540,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Presto, Jack, per pietà!\nQualche cosa, sto male!","translation":"Quick, Jack, for pity's sake!\nSomething... I'm feeling ill!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":541,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(alzandosi premuroso)","translation":"(Rising solicitously.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":542,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Che debbo darvi?","translation":"What shall I give you?"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":543,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(indicando la dispensa)","translation":"(Pointing to the cupboard.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":544,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Là!","translation":"There!"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":545,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Ah! la bottiglia… Vedo…","translation":"Ah! The bottle... I see..."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":546,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(andando verso la dispensa)","translation":"(Going toward the cupboard.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":547,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Ma il bicchiere dov’è?","translation":"But where is the glass?"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":548,"sourcePage":40,"original":"Presto, Jack… Ve lo chiedo\nper pietà!","translation":"Quick, Jack... I beg you,\nfor pity's sake!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":549,"sourcePage":40,"original":"(Minnie approfitta per cambiare rapidamente le carte, mettendo quelle del gioco nel corsetto, prendendo le altre preparate nella calza)","translation":"(Minnie quickly swaps the cards, slipping the cards she held into her bodice and taking the cards hidden in her stocking.)"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":550,"sourcePage":41,"original":"(versa dell’acqua nel bicchiere e si avvicina a Minnie)","translation":"(Rance pours water into a glass and approaches Minnie.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":551,"sourcePage":41,"original":"So perché sei svenuta:\nla partita è perduta!","translation":"I know why you nearly fainted:\nyou've lost the game!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":552,"sourcePage":41,"original":"(si alza trionfante)","translation":"(Rising triumphantly.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":553,"sourcePage":41,"original":"Vi sbagliate. È la gioia! Ho vinto io\nTre assi e un paio!","translation":"You're mistaken. It's joy! I have won:\nthree aces and a pair!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":554,"sourcePage":41,"original":"(guarda le carte di Minnie e poi dice freddamente))","translation":"(He looks at Minnie's cards, then speaks coldly.)"},{"speaker":"RANCE","speakerTranslation":"Rance","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":555,"sourcePage":41,"original":"Buona notte.","translation":"Good night."},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":556,"sourcePage":41,"original":"(Prende soprabito e cappello ed esce rapidamente. – Minnie, appena Rance è uscito, butta per aria il mazzo di carte e ride convulsamente) ","translation":"(He takes his coat and hat and quickly leaves. The moment he is gone, Minnie throws the pack of cards into the air and laughs convulsively.)"},{"speaker":"MINNIE","speakerTranslation":"Minnie","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":557,"sourcePage":41,"original":"Ah, ah, ah!…\nÈ mio!\nAh… è mio!","translation":"Ha, ha, ha!\nHe's mine!\nAh... he's mine!"},{"speaker":"Stage direction","speakerTranslation":"Stage direction","literalText":true,"sourceTurn":558,"sourcePage":41,"original":"(scoppia in un pianto angoscioso e abbraccia la testa di Johnson)).","translation":"(She breaks into anguished sobs and embraces Johnson's head.)"}]}]}];